Package: ramp.forcing
Type: Package
Title: Exogenous Forcing for RAMP
Version: 1.0.0-0
Authors@R: c(
      person("David L.", "Smith", email = "smitdave@uw.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4367-3849"))
    )
Description:
    Algorithms that extend `ramp.xds` models to handle exogenous forcing of all kinds.
    These algorithms are designed to simulate weather (temperature, rainfall, humidity),
    habitat and resource dynamics, malaria vector control (bed nets, IRS, LSM, sugar baits,
    area spraying), and mass treatment and distribution of other health interventions.
